# False-detection and module diagnostics. Captures are operational data — they
# name cameras and tracked people, and they roll to tens of MB. Never commit them.
# Head-count diagnostic logs (Phase 1)
# The DIRECTORY is tracked (via its own .gitignore) so it exists on a fresh clone;
# every file inside it is still ignored, which is the rule the comment above sets.
logs/*
!logs/.gitignore

